From: csagan5 <32685696+csagan5@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2020 14:23:19 +0100
Subject: DoH improvements

Use secure DNS with Quad9 (https://dns.quad9.net/dns-query) by default.
The default is stored as the same settings the page writes when Quad9 is
chosen, so the page and its summary show Quad9 as the selected provider;
other providers, a custom server, or turning secure DNS off can still be
chosen.

Always enforce DoH even with inconsistent system DNS configuration

License: GPL-3.0-only - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-only.html
